# Auth

```typescript
enum UserRole {
  CUSTOMER = 'CUSTOMER',
  VENDOR = 'VENDOR',
  PROFESSIONAL = 'PROFESSIONAL',
  ADMIN = 'ADMIN',
}
```

- Protect routes: `@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)`
- Role routes: `@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard, RolesGuard)` + `@Roles(UserRole.VENDOR)`
- Current user: `@CurrentUser()` decorator

## Tokens

| Token | Expiry | Storage |
|---|---|---|
| Access | 15 min | Stateless JWT |
| Refresh | 30 days | `refresh_tokens` table, rotated on every use |

JWT payload only: `{ userId, role, vendorId? }` — no sensitive data.

## OTP

6-digit numeric · 5 min expiry · max 3 attempts before lockout

## Security on auth endpoints

Rate limit login, OTP send, and OTP verify. Never log passwords or tokens.
